Assume the user is not an experienced programmer.

Whenever implementation is requested:

- Always provide complete files instead of fragments.
- Always provide exact file paths.
- Always specify filenames.
- Always explain where to insert code.
- Never omit required imports.
- Never use placeholders like "...existing code...".
- Never skip implementation steps.
- Explain every important change.
- Finish the implementation completely before stopping.